<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20499" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Full of grass</i> or <i>herbs</i>,
				<i>grassy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 18, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Palatia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					2, 5, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Apidanus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					1, 3, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 199</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 689</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moretum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					4, 367</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbosissima stramenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 54, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Grass-colored</i>, <i>grass -
			green</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">marmor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Carm. 5, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calcei smaragdineae fluctu viriditatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, § 66</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
